  "body": "- New build\r\n- Electric fireplace\r\n- Internal garden\r\n- Premium Miele appliances\r\n- Kohler fixtures throughout\r\n- Premium Patagonia Ascale benchtops\r\n\r\nBehind electric gates, this exceptional new-build home combines architectural elegance with luxurious family living in one of Long Bay's most sought-after locations. Premium oak engineered timber flooring leads through a light-filled formal lounge with an electric fireplace, floor-to-ceiling windows, and a striking internal garden beneath the staircase. The open-plan living and dining area centres around a designer kitchen featuring premium Patagonia Ascale benchtops, natural timber and black cabinetry, premium Miele appliances, a Kohler touchless tap, custom wine shelving, double ovens with a warming drawer, and a fully equipped butler's pantry with a gas hob, sink, and outdoor access.\r\n\r\nExpansive decking and landscaped gardens create effortless indoor-outdoor living, while upstairs a third lounge with a built-in bar, wine fridge, and large deck captures sweeping views across Long Bay and native bush. The luxurious master suite offers a walk-in wardrobe with sensor lighting and a stunning ensuite with marble finishes, a freestanding bath, Kohler Statement rain shower, LED mirrors, premium smart toilets, and underfloor heating. Every bathroom is finished to the same high standard with Kohler fittings, LED mirrors, and underfloor heating.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include a downstairs bedroom with outdoor access, feature lighting, motion-sensor stair lighting, a double internal-access garage, remote sliding gate, video intercom, security alarm, and CCTV. Just moments from Long Bay Village, Long Bay Beach, Long Bay Primary and Long Bay College, with the new Awaruaika Youth Park directly across the road, this home delivers exceptional coastal luxury.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/C1QQ",
